{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a9dac072232be198515248d1e4fd8072b0391442e688665ee319fb54a519d816", "ja": "（『D/Zeal』のお披露目公演が終わった……。\n余韻に浸るのもこれくらいにして、片付けの続きだ！）", "zh": "（『D/Zeal』的首次亮相公演结束了……\n品味余韵的时间就先到此为止，继续收拾吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "fca054be73e88c0416a6c5d86afca1fa042f736e46c5a766f7052cc4dcc738fc", "ja": "{$P$}……こんなところに\nいたんですか？　急にいなくならないでください。", "zh": "{$P$}……原来你在这里啊？\n请你别突然不见踪影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f1a711dc6ed4f47da9b2ddaf4aaf273aa95b6f616793a13a88aa833e1da33ab0", "ja": "お疲れさま、静香。\nいや、すぐに戻ろうと思ってたんだが……。", "zh": "公演辛苦了，静香。\n抱歉，我本来打算马上回去的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "d663b499126ffc6cbf442d45ca44f7c40cff049dd7cac05d15f297f759890879", "ja": "そういう言い訳は、大人としてどうかと思います。\n……それより、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "都大人了居然还找这种借口。\n……先别说这个，请问你现在有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "374ae793fae516bf3de4489528d4033aa729a004b4ef342af5db5ab34d22193f", "ja": "ああ。何か用事か？", "zh": "有啊，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "689316f2669a0b8221c01ac3f69cf864e3a8f9fc71fb43f6fdaef3c120172d1a", "ja": "あの……今回のユニット、いい勉強になりました。\nアイドルとして学ぶことが、たくさんあって……。", "zh": "那个……这次的团体活动让我学到很多。\n身为偶像，我在其中发现了许多值得学习之处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "38c8d7378f1da4808be4b088b939cacb7a4a63af490d343c2c591f5a8ff0c4ae", "ja": "それで……{$P$}に、\nお願いがあるんですけど……。", "zh": "所以……我有件事情\n想请{$P$}帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f47446ac8c3d66870b3f9e95ccecf2e04c76fa8b90cfea0084598b8d1d4a5de0", "ja": "お願い？\n俺にできることなら、構わないけど……。", "zh": "帮忙？\n如果是我能力所及的范围，当然没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "94c86700652ddd16f65aaa3982d3d2b7a7e081936fbfec0951a4d8645bf8fe9f", "ja": "はい。今じゃないんですけど……ちょっと、\n付き合って欲しいところがあるんです。", "zh": "谢谢，不过不是现在……\n我想请你陪我去一个地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "073d599c12dca44c9d4a3305e204a3dd93e039935268ce501a6d14aae9f3d42f", "ja": "来週の週末に、ジュリアさんおすすめの\nロックバンドのライブを観に行くことにしたんです。", "zh": "下周末，我本来要跟茱莉亚一起去\n听她推荐的摇滚乐团演唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "3a132cb6cd10db3daa9798b89b080e1f312661ae9e9fdc29e74582cc2c2c8e95", "ja": "チケットも買ってあるんですけど、\nジュリアさん、用事が入ってしまって……。", "zh": "票也已经买好了，\n但当天茱莉亚临时有事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "378afb803d1041e6f2514aee61ac1e644d8a31d2bdd419f00badfc71d36e4a0b", "ja": "時間が少し遅くなるので、未来と翼には頼めなくて。\nそれで、もしよかったら……。", "zh": "因为演唱会时间有点晚，也没办法找未来和翼一起去。\n所以，如果你不介意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c0331d34caf42dd195f8754aa9aaf908094511d7e6eabb65f822f603f7da4732", "ja": "なんだ、そんな事か。お安い御用だよ。\n静香の勉強のためなら、いくらでも付き合うさ。", "zh": "怎么，原来是这样。\n小事一桩，只要能让静香学到东西，我随时奉陪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "dd1ef7390db578b8a265784f2b9a4317172b95729f4c334ebc1da68bbd45077e", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "谢、谢谢你的帮忙，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "9dbaa56da75dbe8c9eb7ed4bc9643b1c57611d3ed7de9857cf69f04432499577", "ja": "ロックって、うるさいだけじゃないんですね。\n私、あまり詳しくなくて……。", "zh": "原来摇滚乐并不只是吵吵闹闹的呢。\n过去我一直不太了解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bac862df0a2fbad0638b0d0f5011281fe2c8e91cf65b4759a76a221dd101cd0f", "ja": "うん、そうだな。ロックにもいろんなジャンルがあるし\n……ジュリアのおすすめなら、良さそうだ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。摇滚也分成很多类型……\n既然是茱莉亚推荐的乐团，应该很不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "33be08d1c91cefed18c7b7a6aa8148dd36c91ef39e9466478adca7abfe298dd5", "ja": "私も楽しみなんです。……{$P$}と\n出かけるのが、じゃないですよ！？", "zh": "我也很期待……\n可不是期待和{$P$}一起出去喔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1017_p", "source_sha256": "97f457dbc1a94729c4c016d9eccf2959db313546c06d6eb8d7898fa634bb2f81", "ja": "はは、わかってるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，我知道啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "29c90340f401bd035ff1c0d5d63b2f9a52a0d6593a7759c73cceee2b0d143d24", "ja": "そ、そうですか。チケットは私が持っておきますね。\n{$P$}に預けると失くしそうですし。", "zh": "是、是吗？那门票先放在我这边。\n要是让{$P$}保管，总觉得会弄丢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0103_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "ad2fc0e4ba677e7f244d862fd643605af781fbff1fc19cb0e50a72198fc86ca2", "ja": "それじゃ、来週、忘れないでくださいね。\n……約束ですよ？", "zh": "那么，请你下周别忘了赴约。\n……一言为定喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
